sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Sequência UML - Carregamento do Painel Agregado (GET /aggregated-data)

    actor User as Usuário / Recepção
    participant MFE as Microfrontend React
    participant BFF as BFF NestJS
    participant APIM as API Gateway (APIM)
    participant Hotel as Hotel Service (Mongo)
    participant Res as Reservas Service (SQL)
    participant Func as Azure Function Analítica

    User->>MFE: Acessa Dashboard Operacional
    MFE->>BFF: GET /api/v1/aggregated-data?hotelId=H01&date=2026-10-10
    activate BFF

    par Consulta Hotel Service via Gateway
        BFF->>APIM: GET /api/v1/hotel/H01/catalog
        APIM->>Hotel: GET /hotels/H01/catalog
        Hotel-->>APIM: 200 OK (Quartos, Tarifas, Staff)
        APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK (JSON Hotel)
    and Consulta Reservas Service via Gateway
        BFF->>APIM: GET /api/v1/reservations?hotelId=H01&date=2026-10-10
        APIM->>Res: GET /reservations?hotelId=H01&date=2026-10-10
        Res-->>APIM: 200 OK (Hóspedes, Reservas do dia)
        APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK (JSON Reservas)
    and Disparo de Cálculo Analítico via Gateway
        BFF->>APIM: POST /api/v1/analytics/calculate (ocupação e projeção)
        APIM->>Func: POST /api/calculate (Payload de aposentos/reservas)
        alt Resposta Analítica com Sucesso (< 800ms)
            Func-->>APIM: 200 OK ({ occupancyRate: 78.5, projectedRevenue: 14250.00 })
            APIM-->>BFF: 200 OK (Resultados)
        else Timeout Transitório da Function (> 1500ms)
            Note over BFF,Func: Circuit Breaker / Timeout acionado no BFF
            BFF->>BFF: Registra erro analítico e ativa fallback (partial: true)
        end
    end

    Note over BFF: AggregatedDtoAssembler consolida respostas dos 3 serviços
    BFF-->>MFE: 200 OK { hotel, guests, reservations, calculations, metadata: { partial: false } }
    deactivate BFF

    MFE->>MFE: Atualiza estados no HotelContext e renderiza painel reativo
    MFE-->>User: Exibe Grade de Quartos, Ocupação e Reservas sem latência
